# v0.202.0-beta Release Notes

Release: v0.202.0-beta
Date: 2026-08-17
Tag: v0.202.0-beta

## Product CLI

- `ooda lsp` initialize advertises `completionProvider` (trigger `&`).
  Cursor prefix uses line/character. `&Fs` returns `&FsCap`.
  Lock: `scripts/lsp_complete_smoke.oo`.
- Hover still names the identifier under the cursor (`fn add`, not first `fn`).
  Proof: `bin/ooda lsp` on `fixtures/lsp_cursor.oo`.
- `ooda launch --exec NAME` runs the pinned `.oo` after yank/sha/cap gate.
  Without `--exec` it prints the path only. Missing name fails closed.
  Lock: `scripts/pm_launch_exec_smoke.oo`. Fixture: `fixtures/pm_launch_exec/`.
- `ooda bench FILE` times `oodac check` with `now_ms` under `&TimeCap`.
  Prints `ooda bench: check FILE Nms`. No file or missing file exits 2.
  It does not print `ooda bench: ok`.
  Lock: `scripts/bench_smoke.oo`.

## Pin

- CLI `ooda version` prints `0.202.0-beta`.
- `install/BOOTSTRAP_PIN`, `std.pin`, `ooda.pkg`, install layout default
  match `v0.202.0-beta`.

## Residual

- Public install stays paused. Seed `oodac` still fails this pin's CLI
  check (`oo_fs_rmdir`). Rebuild CLI with tree `oodac_bin` or a later
  compiler. C emit + gcc remains the product path.
